miaz (0.1.26-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New plugin MiAZAIAssistant: AI-powered field suggestions via Claude, OpenAI, Gemini, Ollama.
  * New plugin MiAZNotes: attach Markdown notes to documents with backup/restore.
  * New plugin MiAZColumnVisibility: toggle workspace column visibility.
  * Rename dialog: inline Add buttons on restricted-vocabulary rows.
  * Rename dialog: Concept autocomplete via difflib popover.
  * Workspace: Adw.InlineViewSwitcher for workspace views.
  * Backend: filename_guess_date() helper for smart date detection.

